title: Vinaigrette
image: https://www.startpage.com/av/proxy-image?piurl=https%3A%2F%2Fcache.marieclaire.fr%2Fdata%2Fphoto%2Fw2000_ci%2F60%2Frecettes-vinaigrettes-1.jpg&sp=1780220672T57958d22a910c0ce03bc030e1d8e3e230071f0997871007f9e956662acd32af6
